					}
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "TicketDetail",
			"_note": "The ticket page in the simple structure (openspec/changes/simple-ticket-page). The full structure has no overlay, so its page is today's page. STAGE: `status`, the ticket's own lifecycle field. EVERY STATUS CHANGE HERE IS A TRANSITION OF THE SCHEMA'S x-openregister-lifecycle, posted to OpenRegister's transition endpoint, which checks the `from` state and the authorization again. `visibleWhen` only hides a button on a status its transition cannot leave; it decides nothing. The spec fails when an action names a transition the schema lacks or shows on a status outside the transition's `from`. THE DESIGN NAMES THREE THINGS PIPELINQ DOES NOT HAVE and they are not invented: a reminder to a customer who does not answer (the waiting stage offers Answer again), a step from answered to closed (resolved, completed, rejected, converted and closed are all final, so a finished ticket has no primary button), and a convert-to-case header action (conversion needs an availability answer first, so it stays the self-hiding section it is). A CONTACT MOMENT HAS NO CUSTOMER TO ANSWER: Answer hides on it, the stage then has no primary button, and Close the ticket is in the More menu. THE ANSWER IS WRITTEN IN ONE PLACE: `customer-reply` leaves the body and opens as a dialog from the Answer button, and the body shows the conversation to read. THE GRID IS ONE TABS WIDGET, full width: beside the side column the grid is narrow, and three cards side by side would stack. LOG CONTACT SEEDS THE TICKET AND NOT THE CUSTOMER: the library leaves a token it cannot resolve in place, so `@object.contact` on a ticket without a contact would be saved as those fifteen characters, a foreign key to nothing. `@objectId` always resolves. The contact moment hangs on the ticket, and the ticket names the customer. THE WHAT-NOW CARD (DqZaak, Acties: one next-step button inside a card that lists what the step still needs): `nextStep` names a checklist per stage on fields the ticket has (assignee, client, slaDeadline, portalReplies), and the stage's primary button sits in the card. A finished ticket has no stage entry, so it shows no card. Nothing in the checklist is a guess: an item is done when its field holds a value.",
			"config": {
				"stageField": "status",
				"headerActions": [
					{
						"id": "assign-to-me",
						"type": "api-call",
						"group": "Status",
						"label": "Assign to me",
						"icon": "AccountArrowLeftOutline",
						"url": "/apps/pipelinq/api/tickets/@objectId/assign-to-me",
						"method": "POST",
						"successMessage": "Assigned to you. It is on your My Work now.",
						"errorMessage": "Could not assign this ticket to you."
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-start",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Take on",
						"icon": "AccountCheckOutline",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "start"
						},
						"successMessage": "The ticket is in progress.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"field": "status",
							"op": "eq",
							"value": "new"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-answer",
						"type": "open-modal",
						"target": "TicketAnswerDialog",
						"label": "Answer the customer",
						"icon": "ForumOutline",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"field": "ticketType",
							"op": "neq",
							"value": "interaction"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-log-contact",
						"type": "open-form",
						"label": "Log contact",
						"formTitle": "Log contact",
						"icon": "Phone",
						"register": "pipelinq",
						"schema": "ticket",
						"props": {
							"ticketType": "interaction",
							"parentTicket": "@objectId"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-resume",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Back to in progress",
						"icon": "AccountCheckOutline",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "resume"
						},
						"successMessage": "The ticket is in progress.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"field": "status",
							"op": "eq",
							"value": "awaiting_customer"
						},
						"group": "Status"
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-complete",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Complete",
						"icon": "CheckCircle",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "complete"
						},
						"successMessage": "The ticket is completed.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"all": [
								{
									"field": "status",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "in_progress"
								},
								{
									"field": "ticketType",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "request"
								}
							]
						},
						"group": "Finish"
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-resolve",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Resolve",
						"icon": "CheckCircle",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "resolve"
						},
						"successMessage": "The complaint is resolved.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"all": [
								{
									"field": "status",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "in_progress"
								},
								{
									"field": "ticketType",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "complaint"
								}
							]
						},
						"group": "Finish"
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-close",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Close the ticket",
						"icon": "Check",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "close"
						},
						"successMessage": "The contact moment is closed.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"all": [
								{
									"any": [
										{
											"field": "status",
											"op": "eq",
											"value": "new"
										},
										{
											"field": "status",
											"op": "eq",
											"value": "in_progress"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"field": "ticketType",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "interaction"
								}
							]
						},
						"group": "Finish"
					},
					{
						"id": "ticket-reject",
						"type": "api-call",
						"label": "Reject",
						"icon": "Check",
						"url": "/apps/openregister/api/objects/@objectId/transition",
						"method": "POST",
						"payload": {
							"action": "reject"
						},
						"successMessage": "The ticket is rejected.",
						"visibleWhen": {
							"any": [
								{
									"field": "status",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "new"
								},
								{
									"field": "status",
									"op": "eq",
									"value": "in_progress"
								}
							]
						},
						"group": "Finish"
					}
				],
				"primaryActionByStage": {
					"new": "ticket-start",
					"in_progress": "ticket-answer",
					"awaiting_customer": "ticket-answer"
				},
				"nextStep": {
					"title": "What now?",
					"stages": {
